# 17. Middleware (HOT)

## What is middleware?

Code that runs **before and after every request**.

---

## Logging middleware

```python
@app.middleware('http')
async def log_requests(request, call_next):
    start = time.time()

    response = await call_next(request)

    duration = time.time() - start
    print(f'{request.method} {request.url} took {duration}')

    return response
```

---

## Common middleware

- CORS
- Logging
- Authentication
- Rate limiting
- Request ID / tracing

