# 21. WebSockets (Advanced)

## Server

```python
from fastapi import WebSocket

@app.websocket('/ws')
async def websocket_endpoint(ws: WebSocket):
    await ws.accept()

    while True:
        data = await ws.receive_text()
        await ws.send_text(f'Echo: {data}')
```

---

## Use cases

- Chat apps
- Live dashboard
- Notifications
- Real-time tracking

