# 27. Celery vs BackgroundTasks

| BackgroundTasks | Celery |
|---|---|
| Same process | Separate workers |
| Simple | Distributed |
| No retry | Retry support |
| Lightweight | Production-grade |
| Small tasks | Long-running tasks |

### Interview answer

Use **BackgroundTasks for lightweight work** and **Celery for heavy or distributed tasks requiring retries and monitoring**.

