# 32. Best One-Line Definitions

## Pydantic

```text
Pydantic is a data validation and serialization library that uses Python type hints to validate and convert incoming and outgoing data.
```

## Dependency Injection

```text
A design pattern where dependencies are provided to a function instead of being created inside it.
```

## Connection Pooling

```text
A technique that reuses database connections to improve performance and reduce connection overhead.
```

## Middleware

```text
Code that intercepts every request and response for cross-cutting concerns such as logging, authentication, and CORS.
```

## Async

```text
A concurrency model that allows a program to handle other tasks while waiting for I/O operations to complete.
```

